  "sangamTamil": "எய்தி யிருந்த அவைமுன்னர்ச் சென்றெள்ளி\nவைதான் ஒருவன் ஒருவனை - வைய\nவயப்பட்டான் வாளா இருப்பானேல், வைதான்\nவியத்தக்கான் வாழும் எனின்.",
  "urai": null,
  "english": "The evil tongue. A man has gone before the assembly that had gathered together, and contemning another has reviled him. Now if the reviled one remain silent, the reviler is to be wondered at if he survive; (for abuse is his very life, and the patience of the reviled one has closed his mouth.)",
